/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 178 0 R
/E (Banks use telephonic marketing campaigns to promote term deposit subscriptions, but contacting every customer is time-consuming and expensive. The objective of this project is to analyze customer and campaign data to identify patterns influencing customer decisions and build a machine learning model that predicts whether a client is likely to subscribe to a term deposit. This helps banks improve marketing efficiency, reduce operational costs, and target potential customers more effectively.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
