/P 629 0 R
/E (This indicates that the marketing campaign had a low conversion rate. The dataset is also highly imbalanced because the no class is much larger than the yes class. Because of this, accuracy alone is not enough to judge the machine learning model. For example, a model could predict no for most clients and still get high accuracy. So, metrics like precision, recall, F1 score, and ROC-AUC are more useful for evaluating model performance.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [3]
